 R←Test_32(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;home;QEN
⍝ The name of a parameter space that does not exist makes `Process` carry on with the defaults
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

⍝ Preconditions...
 home←GetDefaultErrorFolder
 {}FilesAndDirs.RmDir home
 {}'CREATE!'FilesAndDirs.CheckPath home

 ⎕TRAP←(405 'E' '406 ##.HandleError.Process ''#.HandleError_Test_32_DoesNotExist''')(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 :Trap 406
     {⎕SIGNAL ⍵}405
     →T.GoToTidyUp 1
 :EndTrap

 QEN←⎕EN
 →T.GoToTidyUp 406≠QEN
 →T.GoToTidyUp 1≠≢FilesAndDirs.ListFiles home,'/*.dcf'

 R←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 {}FilesAndDirs.RmDir home
